class.description:
Check [member status] first. Only [constant STATUS_OK] and [constant STATUS_INCOMPATIBLE] have an [member info], and only [constant STATUS_OK] has a [member latency_ms].
[codeblock]
if result.is_ok():
    print("%d/%d players, %d ms" % [
        result.info.players, result.info.max_players, result.latency_ms,
    ])
elif result.status == NetwProbeResult.STATUS_INCOMPATIBLE:
    show_banner("That server runs a different build.")
[/codeblock]
A [NetwTransport] creates results with the static methods.
